            0.186
          ],
          "content": "**Arrange the following lengths in increasing order:** $4 { \\frac { 1 } { 1 0 } }$ $^ { \\frac { 4 } { 1 0 } } , ^ { \\frac { 4 1 } { 1 0 } } , ^ { 4 1 } { \\textstyle \\frac { 1 } { 1 0 } }$"
