            0.216
          ],
          "content": "**Ans:**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.187,
            0.216,
            0.548,
            0.25
          ],
          "content": "Increasing order: $\\frac{4}{10}, \\frac{41}{10} = 4\\frac{1}{10}, 41\\frac{1}{10}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.265,
            0.238,
            0.283
          ],
          "content": "**Page No. 51**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.3,
            0.868,
            0.343
          ],
          "content": "**The lengths of the body parts of a honeybee are given. Find its total length.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "bbox": [
            0.121,
            0.356,
            0.878,
            0.518
          ],
          "content": "<table><tr><td><img src=\"images/page_36_table_image_6_1.jpg\"/></td><td> $\\boxed { \\mathrm { H e a d } \\; = \\; 2 \\frac { 3 } { 1 0 } \\; \\mathrm { u n i t s } }$   $\\mathrm { T h o r a x } \\; = \\; 5 \\frac { 4 } { 1 0 } \\; \\mathrm { u n i t s }$ </td></tr></table>",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_36_table_6.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.121,
            0.532,
            0.285,
            0.564
          ],
          "content": "**Ans:** $1 5   \\frac { 2 } { 1 0 }$ units."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
